#: ../../content/residents/procedure-emmenagement.md:56
msgid "What it is for"
msgstr "Waarvoor ze dient"

#: ../../content/residents/procedure-emmenagement.md:56
msgid "**Sign the agreement with the resident's representative**"
msgstr "**De overeenkomst ondertekenen met de vertegenwoordiger van de bewoner**"

#: ../../content/residents/procedure-emmenagement.md:56
msgid "**Entry / exit condition report (état des lieux)**"
msgstr "**Plaatsbeschrijving bij in- / uittrede**"

#: ../../content/residents/procedure-emmenagement.md:56
msgid "**Update the resident's private inventory**"
msgstr "**De privé-inventaris van de bewoner bijwerken**"

#: ../../content/residents/procedure-emmenagement.md:56
